{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trials of Valor is a  roguelike fighting game. Inspired by classic RPGs, it blends simple class-based characters with fast, skill-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your path across a boardgame-style map. Fight enemies, collect gear and face powerful bosses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select your starting class and build your own unique playstyle. Use your attacks, abilities  dodges and blocks to overcome every challenge in this unforgiving world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Real-time combat</i>:\u00a0Evade, block and attack in real time. Use powerful abilities to your advantage. Perfect timing can be the difference between life and death. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Procedural content</i>:\u00a0Every run is different with randomized map content and gear modifiers.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Wield for the occasion:</i> Choose the right time to use your primary and secondary weapon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/Map_View_Gif_1.gif?t=1750870613\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What you're up against</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30+ enemies, each with their own strengths and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 maps with different paths and biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ selectable abilities\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ positive/negative gear modifiers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ charms to increase your chance of victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ character stats that are easy to understand</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Countless weapons and gear pieces to equip</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wishlist now to receive a notification when this exciting adventure releases!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3787340?t=1750870613","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3787340?t=1750870613","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/1445b6927143a77b3a51a58713fafccadc2209df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750870613","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/1445b6927143a77b3a51a58713fafccadc2209df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750870613","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood and gore\r\nViolence"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trials of Valor is a  roguelike fighting game. Inspired by classic RPGs, it blends simple class-based characters with fast, skill-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your path across a boardgame-style map. Fight enemies, collect gear and face powerful bosses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select your starting class and build your own unique playstyle. Use your attacks, abilities  dodges and blocks to overcome every challenge in this unforgiving world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Real-time combat</i>:\u00a0Evade, block and attack in real time. Use powerful abilities to your advantage. Perfect timing can be the difference between life and death. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Procedural content</i>:\u00a0Every run is different with randomized map content and gear modifiers.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Wield for the occasion:</i> Choose the right time to use your primary and secondary weapon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_